# Stable addresses for the apps' update feeds, the Linux package source,
# the links in the apps and the release notes (docs/architecture.md §12). Each one leads to
# where the releases are hosted now, so moving them to another host
# changes only these lines, never an installed app. 302, not 301, so no
# client keeps an old target.
/latest/*    https://github.com/tasict/InputWeave/releases/latest/download/:splat  302
/download/*  https://github.com/tasict/InputWeave/releases/download/:splat  302
/releases  https://github.com/tasict/InputWeave/releases  302
/releases/latest  https://github.com/tasict/InputWeave/releases/latest  302
/releases/*  https://github.com/tasict/InputWeave/releases/tag/:splat  302
/user-guide  https://github.com/tasict/InputWeave/blob/main/docs/user-guide.md  302
/zh-Hant/user-guide  https://github.com/tasict/InputWeave/blob/main/docs/user-guide.zh-TW.md  302
/issues  https://github.com/tasict/InputWeave/issues  302
